{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"In **ResStock 2025 Release 1**:\n\n- **49% of housing units are in one-story buildings**, according to the Geometry Stories stock saturation in Table 11.\n- The characteristic’s data source is **U.S. EIA 2009 Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS) microdata**.\n- **Basements are excluded** from the story count. Stories are floors above grade; finished attics are included.\n\nSource: [*ResStock Technical Reference Guide: 2025 Release 1*, “Geometry Stories,” p. 54, Table 11](https://natlabrockies.github.io/ResStock.github.io/assets/trd/ResStockTechnicalReferenceGuide_2025_1.pdf)."}}
